{"id":"9e0334547580ab00","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat.md","title":"历史入口","display":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat","16-fhodtt-cat-model"],"display":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]"],"source":"Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat</span><span>16-fhodtt-cat-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a> 的结构记录，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 是其中定义的普通版本谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 仅标识保留的历史拼写。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用完整记录，保留 kinds、types 的同底反射及两层闭理解；旧三参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,q,\\chi)\">\\((p,q,\\chi)\\)</span> 不足以承载本书结构。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2, pp. 694–695 (PDF 714–715)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$ 为 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 的结构记录，$\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}$ 是其中定义的普通版本谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M).","display":true},{"tex":"(p,q,\\chi)","display":false}],"bytes":1082,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model-compat|df-fhodtt-categorical-model — 历史入口]